# =============================================================================
# Secrets — NEVER commit. All real values live in .env (see .env.example).
# =============================================================================
.env
**/.env
!.env.example
secret.txt
**/secrets.env

# Legacy secret locations (kept so old checkouts can't leak them)
scripts/secrets.env

# Personal access/reference sheet (URLs, IPs, where creds live) — never commit.
ACCESS.md

